WEBVTT

00:34.360 --> 00:35.960
In the World Beyond,

00:36.360 --> 00:38.400
humans take Potions

00:39.120 --> 00:41.520
to gain various Beyonder powers

00:41.800 --> 00:44.560
and advance to higher Sequences
in a Pathway.

00:46.080 --> 00:48.360
All 22 Pathways

00:48.760 --> 00:50.680
begin from Sequence 9,

00:51.480 --> 00:53.320
and the lower the Sequence number is,

00:53.840 --> 00:56.120
the stronger the Beyonder powers.

00:57.360 --> 00:59.000
A High-Sequence Beyonder

00:59.560 --> 01:02.720
can possess powers
comparable to a deity.

01:03.760 --> 01:06.360
And such Pathways

01:07.360 --> 01:09.600
are Pathways to Divinity.

01:49.391 --> 01:52.832
=Episode 6=
(Teacher: Every Life Has Its Meaning)

01:54.895 --> 01:56.096
(Nighthawks internal files)

02:00.079 --> 02:02.272
(August 18th, 1349, Lamud Castle)

02:03.280 --> 02:04.160
(August 18th.)

02:04.880 --> 02:06.800
(Miss Elizabeth came
for a dream interpretation.)

02:08.080 --> 02:09.520
(Since returning from Lamud Town,)

02:09.880 --> 02:11.200
(she's had constant nightmares.)

02:12.560 --> 02:13.440
(In her nightmares,)

02:13.960 --> 02:15.640
(I saw an abandoned castle)

02:16.520 --> 02:18.080
(and a knight's wraith.)

02:23.072 --> 02:25.400
Captain, there's indeed a wraith
in the castle.

02:26.400 --> 02:28.480
(Wraiths that invade dreams
are really powerful.)

02:28.896 --> 02:29.760
(So,)

02:29.760 --> 02:31.560
(the captain
specifically brought 3-0782,)

02:32.360 --> 02:33.640
(Mutated Sun Sacred Emblem.)

02:34.920 --> 02:37.360
3-0782 can cause wraiths
within 15 meters to dissipate

02:37.720 --> 02:38.880
within one minute.

02:39.560 --> 02:42.040
It can also turn Beyonders
in its range into idiots,

02:42.360 --> 02:44.240
who only praise the sun in six hours.

02:45.720 --> 02:46.760
Two and a half hours left.

02:47.104 --> 02:48.000
Intensify the search.

03:35.600 --> 03:36.800
Dust falls like snow.

03:38.368 --> 03:39.232
Up there!

04:00.591 --> 04:01.431
(Requiem Charm)

04:02.016 --> 04:02.880
Crimson

04:03.264 --> 04:04.192
Requiem.

04:17.840 --> 04:18.960
This wraith is unusual.

04:19.320 --> 04:20.840
Frye, find its weakness.

04:30.528 --> 04:31.488
Captain!

04:42.400 --> 04:43.960
Found it! The right-hand glove.

04:51.168 --> 04:52.128
Klein!

05:04.000 --> 05:04.864
(It doesn't hurt.)

05:10.080 --> 05:11.040
(This is)

05:11.712 --> 05:12.560
(a dream?)

05:22.440 --> 05:23.440
Over a minute passed.

05:40.200 --> 05:41.680
Good thing we brought 3-0782.

05:41.880 --> 05:42.920
Or it could've gone wrong.

05:46.920 --> 05:49.080
Captain, this wraith feels unnatural.

05:49.080 --> 05:49.984
Its obsession is deep.

05:51.520 --> 05:52.600
A wraith of this level

05:53.000 --> 05:54.240
has existed for centuries.

05:54.960 --> 05:56.360
Although the castle's ancient,

05:56.560 --> 05:57.520
none of the folktales

05:58.240 --> 05:59.760
is related to wraiths.

06:00.640 --> 06:01.568
This wraith

06:01.800 --> 06:03.360
likely emerged recently.

06:03.680 --> 06:04.520
Captain.

06:14.640 --> 06:15.600
Judging by the style,

06:16.040 --> 06:17.680
it's a work from the late Fourth Epoch.

06:18.120 --> 06:19.440
Over a thousand years ago?

06:19.920 --> 06:21.200
The late Fourth Epoch

06:22.200 --> 06:23.960
was probably when this castle was built.

06:24.760 --> 06:25.632
This person

06:26.320 --> 06:28.080
might've been the castle's first owner,

06:28.680 --> 06:31.360
the first Baron Lamud,
who mysteriously vanished in legends.

06:32.520 --> 06:34.120
(This person looks familiar.)

06:36.040 --> 06:37.400
(Isn't this Mr. Azik?)

06:39.440 --> 06:40.360
(No way.)

06:41.080 --> 06:43.760
(Klein's revered teacher
is a thousand-year-old being?)

06:44.384 --> 06:45.248
(No, wait.)

06:45.880 --> 06:46.760
(Just a likeness.)

06:47.520 --> 06:49.160
(Mr. Azik is much gentler.)

06:51.040 --> 06:52.720
The wraiths here
should've been purified.

06:53.400 --> 06:55.000
But considering their nature,

06:55.480 --> 06:57.280
let's keep guarding this place
a while longer

06:57.640 --> 06:58.880
to ensure complete resolution.

06:59.520 --> 07:00.448
Standard procedure.

07:01.320 --> 07:02.920
One person guards with 3-0782.

07:03.440 --> 07:04.520
Others rest and recover.

07:05.080 --> 07:06.160
Rotate every two hours.

07:07.080 --> 07:07.960
I'll take first watch.

07:08.256 --> 07:09.200
You all rest.

07:10.560 --> 07:11.456
Okay.

07:11.648 --> 07:12.576
We'll stay outside.

07:13.120 --> 07:14.120
Call if anything happens.

07:22.160 --> 07:23.280
It's so warm and soothing.

07:24.960 --> 07:26.320
It seems extremely effective

07:26.480 --> 07:27.880
against spiritual monsters.

07:28.600 --> 07:30.040
Works better than Requiem Charm.

07:31.160 --> 07:32.280
The files only show

07:32.600 --> 07:34.040
this emblem came from Intis

07:34.680 --> 07:35.840
and relates to Sun Pathway.

07:36.280 --> 07:37.360
It has an unknown origin.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.360
Interference, perhaps?

07:41.400 --> 07:43.080
If I perform divination
on the gray mist,

07:43.640 --> 07:44.800
will it cut interference?

07:48.680 --> 07:50.336
I need a more secluded spot.

08:00.880 --> 08:02.120
The texture feels quite real.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.680
Directly manifested through my feelings?

08:08.416 --> 08:10.464
(Divination)

08:14.000 --> 08:16.480
(Origin of the Mutated
Sun Sacred Emblem.)

08:26.080 --> 08:27.000
(Eternal Blazing Sun?)

08:29.344 --> 08:30.208
(That's right.)

08:30.720 --> 08:32.800
(Eternal Blazing Sun
controls the Sun Pathway.)

08:47.120 --> 08:48.280
(That drop of golden liquid)

08:48.840 --> 08:51.480
(is the reason why 3-0782
can't be sealed or controlled.)

09:05.184 --> 09:06.040
(What exactly)

09:06.560 --> 09:07.560
(is this thing?)

09:08.920 --> 09:10.720
(Some high-grade Beyonder material?)

09:39.264 --> 09:40.680
It hurts! It hurts so much!

10:22.048 --> 10:22.976
(What happened?)

10:23.360 --> 10:24.240
(The divination)

10:24.800 --> 10:25.960
(pointed to a sun.)

10:28.400 --> 10:29.600
(Was it Eternal Blazing Sun?)

10:30.160 --> 10:31.600
(I actually gazed upon a deity?)

10:33.880 --> 10:35.200
(Hadn't the gray mist helped,)

10:35.680 --> 10:37.040
(I'd have turned to ashes.)

10:37.720 --> 10:39.320
(I can't divine everything from now on.)

10:39.920 --> 10:41.400
(Who knows what horrors I might see?)

10:50.400 --> 10:52.040
(T-These are...)

10:53.240 --> 10:54.480
(White Angel?)

10:55.640 --> 10:57.640
(Flaring Sun Charm's
crafting techniques?)

10:58.520 --> 10:59.640
(Sun Pathway?)

11:00.400 --> 11:01.280
(Unshadowed?)

11:02.240 --> 11:03.400
(Priest of Light?)

11:04.240 --> 11:05.920
(Never gaze upon a deity)
(Never gaze upon a deity?)

11:06.560 --> 11:07.440
(Oh my!)

11:08.064 --> 11:08.928
(What is this?)

11:09.760 --> 11:11.440
(My reward for enduring a god's wrath)

11:11.760 --> 11:12.880
(alone for a full minute?)

11:13.664 --> 11:14.656
(Sequence 4: Unshadowed)
(Wait.)

11:15.200 --> 11:16.040
(Sequence 4?)

11:17.080 --> 11:19.240
(This is my first
high-sequence formula.)

11:20.040 --> 11:22.320
(So, that golden liquid
is divine blood.)

11:22.840 --> 11:23.800
(3-0782)

11:24.000 --> 11:25.760
(is far more powerful
than anyone imagined.)

11:26.440 --> 11:27.560
I need to find a chance

11:27.800 --> 11:29.280
to exploit that divine blood again.

11:36.040 --> 11:37.056
(That's it for today.)

11:37.536 --> 11:38.464
(Time to go back)

11:39.040 --> 11:40.288
(before my teammates notice.)

11:51.840 --> 11:53.680
(Luckily, there's nothing unusual.)

11:55.040 --> 11:56.720
I must stop taking such reckless risks.

11:57.120 --> 11:58.400
Never gaze upon a deity.

11:58.960 --> 12:00.160
I must remember that.

12:02.080 --> 12:03.040
I'm so tired.

12:04.120 --> 12:06.640
(By the way, what is White Angel?)

12:12.440 --> 12:13.920
The castle's wraiths are purified.

12:14.720 --> 12:17.480
The lady asking for dream interpretation
should face no more troubles.

12:20.960 --> 12:23.080
We'll return 3-0782 to Blackthorn first.

12:23.936 --> 12:24.832
You should rest now.

12:25.400 --> 12:26.400
Good work, Klein.

12:37.852 --> 12:40.696
(Lord of Mysteries)

12:42.553 --> 12:44.967
(First Epoch: The Age of Chaos;
Second Epoch: The Dark Epoch)

12:44.967 --> 12:47.377
(Third Epoch: The Cataclysm Epoch; Fourth Epoch:
The Epoch of the Gods; Fifth Epoch: The Iron Age)

12:55.023 --> 12:55.960
(Hoy University)

12:55.960 --> 12:56.920
(Mr. Azik)

12:57.160 --> 12:58.520
(found information on Hornacis?)

13:04.920 --> 13:06.040
Should I go up?

13:07.120 --> 13:08.360
I do want to know more.

13:08.704 --> 13:09.568
But...

13:10.640 --> 13:11.720
Does Mr. Azik

13:11.960 --> 13:14.000
have any connection
with the man in that painting?

13:28.120 --> 13:29.640
Excuse me, Mr. Azik.

13:36.800 --> 13:38.280
(Mr. Azik seems to be not here.)

14:07.840 --> 14:09.120
(Lamud Castle?)

14:09.960 --> 14:11.200
(So that painting is truly...?)

14:21.640 --> 14:22.720
M-Mr. Azik.

14:23.328 --> 14:24.200
You weren't here.

14:24.640 --> 14:25.600
I saw this painting

14:25.760 --> 14:27.000
and unconsciously walked in.

14:28.360 --> 14:29.960
Lately I've been having strange dreams.

14:30.960 --> 14:31.808
After waking up,

14:32.240 --> 14:33.520
I found that I drew this.

14:34.720 --> 14:35.640
It's rather troubling.

14:36.896 --> 14:37.792
Come with me.

14:39.328 --> 14:40.224
Dreams?

14:47.280 --> 14:49.560
Research on Ancient Ruins
of Main Peak of Hornacis.

14:50.640 --> 14:51.640
Thank you, Mr. Azik.

14:52.040 --> 14:53.160
Then I'll just...

14:54.080 --> 14:54.944
Read them here.

14:59.400 --> 15:01.280
You're no longer a student
at Hoy University.

15:02.160 --> 15:03.072
These materials

15:03.360 --> 15:04.480
cannot leave the university.

15:07.488 --> 15:08.416
Have a seat.

15:08.880 --> 15:09.720
You seem

15:10.400 --> 15:11.680
rather tense today.

15:14.120 --> 15:15.240
I'm just too excited.

15:15.840 --> 15:18.440
After all, I've longed
for Hornacis materials for ages.

15:22.040 --> 15:24.360
(This resembles the palace
I saw in my dream divination.)

15:25.520 --> 15:27.440
(But that one was atop a peak,
more magnificent,)

15:28.600 --> 15:30.800
(with an enormous throne
not meant for humans.)

15:33.160 --> 15:34.240
(Hornacis Mountain Range)

15:34.360 --> 15:35.880
(straddles Loen and Intis.)

15:36.360 --> 15:37.320
(Ruins confirm)

15:37.720 --> 15:38.720
(that long ago,)

15:39.200 --> 15:41.280
(an ancient nation existed here.)

15:43.160 --> 15:46.080
(The Nation of the Evernight mentioned
by Antigonus Family's Notebook?)

15:47.560 --> 15:48.800
(Judging by murals,)

15:49.440 --> 15:52.840
(its people's appearance
resembled modern humans.)

15:53.480 --> 15:54.640
(They can be seen as human.)

15:55.400 --> 15:57.440
(They believed death wasn't the end,)

15:58.200 --> 15:59.160
(and deceased family)

15:59.480 --> 16:01.040
(would protect them in the darkness.)

16:01.720 --> 16:03.600
(They kept the deceased
by their pillows)

16:03.880 --> 16:04.840
(for three full days.)

16:05.600 --> 16:06.464
(Afterward...)

16:07.080 --> 16:08.120
(The murals end here.)

16:08.560 --> 16:09.800
(There are no burial elements.)

16:10.560 --> 16:11.760
(Within these ancient ruins,)

16:12.120 --> 16:14.480
(all displays and furnishings
remain intact.)

16:14.760 --> 16:16.040
(Traces of daily life exist.)

16:16.880 --> 16:17.880
(Yet strangely...)

16:18.600 --> 16:19.800
I was at this page too.

16:20.608 --> 16:21.472
Thank you.

16:22.560 --> 16:24.440
No tombs. No remains.

16:25.640 --> 16:26.880
The people vanished instantly

16:27.480 --> 16:29.160
as if they never existed.

16:30.320 --> 16:32.960
Moreover, this ancient civilization
worshiped a mysterious entity.

16:33.960 --> 16:35.080
They reverently called "Her"

16:35.560 --> 16:36.520
Ruler of the Evernight

16:37.040 --> 16:37.920
and Mother of the Sky.

16:38.880 --> 16:40.000
Ruler of the Evernight?

16:40.704 --> 16:42.640
Are Nation of the Evernight
and Mother of the Sky

16:43.240 --> 16:44.480
related to Evernight Goddess?

16:47.320 --> 16:50.440
Klein, aren't you drinking your coffee?

16:56.992 --> 16:57.888
So bitter.

17:04.280 --> 17:06.160
You usually add a sugar cube.

17:09.480 --> 17:11.040
My taste is different lately.

17:13.240 --> 17:15.920
I've been studying mysticism recently.

17:17.040 --> 17:17.952
I discovered

17:18.840 --> 17:19.760
your fate

17:20.200 --> 17:21.480
shows dissonant ripples.

17:23.760 --> 17:24.840
How dissonant?

17:25.856 --> 17:26.784
Regrettably,

17:27.440 --> 17:29.640
I sense the ripples
will bring you danger

17:30.480 --> 17:32.600
but can't decipher further details.

17:34.280 --> 17:35.640
However, one thing is clear.

17:36.760 --> 17:38.680
The dissonant part of your fate

17:39.920 --> 17:41.760
subtly points toward me.

17:43.480 --> 17:45.600
You've seen this castle recently, right?

17:48.280 --> 17:50.560
Your emotions surged intensely
when viewing it.

17:51.296 --> 17:52.224
When facing me,

17:52.680 --> 17:54.480
you display unprecedented tension.

17:57.856 --> 17:58.752
You

17:59.880 --> 18:01.480
know some of my secrets.

18:09.600 --> 18:10.496
Don't be alarmed.

18:12.512 --> 18:13.360
I merely

18:14.280 --> 18:15.720
want to reclaim my past.

18:18.280 --> 18:19.280
Past?

18:30.048 --> 18:30.912
(Stay calm.)

18:31.680 --> 18:33.600
(I had the chance to divine
before setting out.)

18:34.016 --> 18:34.912
(It will be fine.)

18:36.320 --> 18:38.240
(Mr. Azik has always
been kind to Klein.)

18:39.008 --> 18:39.936
(The divination showed)

18:40.440 --> 18:42.520
(if I tell Mr. Azik about the castle)

18:43.000 --> 18:44.560
(and keep it from the Nighthawks,)

18:45.472 --> 18:46.760
(he'll save me someday.)

18:48.360 --> 18:49.200
In my dreams,

18:50.080 --> 18:51.760
it wasn't this fragmented.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.600
Mr. Azik,

18:55.360 --> 18:56.720
you are quite old-fashioned.

18:57.920 --> 18:58.840
The stable was here

18:59.760 --> 19:00.920
with my favorite white horse.

19:25.840 --> 19:27.280
My child used to play here often.

19:28.200 --> 19:30.760
He loved dragging a sword
heavier than himself around,

19:32.120 --> 19:33.120
saying,

19:34.080 --> 19:35.520
"I'm the king's knight."

19:36.280 --> 19:37.120
(A long sword?)

19:38.600 --> 19:39.800
(That wraith was his child?)

20:12.040 --> 20:12.960
Mr. Azik,

20:13.120 --> 20:13.984
what's wrong?

20:45.080 --> 20:45.960
What was that?

20:46.960 --> 20:48.320
Mr. Azik's dream?

20:52.240 --> 20:53.120
Are you all right,

20:53.520 --> 20:54.368
Mr. Azik?

21:03.240 --> 21:04.520
(Such damp and filthy air.)

21:05.320 --> 21:06.560
(Evil is suppressed below.)

21:20.320 --> 21:21.248
This is

21:21.800 --> 21:24.080
like some corpse-sealing ritual
to contain resentment.

21:34.080 --> 21:35.080
It was sabotaged.

22:02.520 --> 22:03.680
Mr. Azik...

22:33.040 --> 22:34.520
We completely cleansed this place.

22:35.120 --> 22:36.200
Why so many spirits still?

23:22.520 --> 23:23.440
Where am I...?

23:25.240 --> 23:26.112
Something's there!

23:26.400 --> 23:27.560
There's something inside!

23:49.120 --> 23:50.560
(Mr. Azik?)

23:52.440 --> 23:54.240
A curse.

23:58.160 --> 24:01.840
The pale spirit returning from beyond

24:01.960 --> 24:04.160
will bring suffering,

24:04.400 --> 24:05.560
disaster,

24:05.800 --> 24:08.320
and death!

24:08.520 --> 24:09.520
Kill him!

26:28.560 --> 26:31.280
Azik Eggers has demonstrated
exceptional combat valor

26:32.080 --> 26:33.280
and is hereby conferred

26:33.640 --> 26:35.240
the title of Grand Baron of Lamud,

26:36.520 --> 26:37.440
granted fief,

26:38.160 --> 26:39.920
and awarded with the First Class Medal

26:40.360 --> 26:41.760
of Augusto.

26:45.280 --> 26:46.144
Mother,

26:46.280 --> 26:47.320
when I grow up,

26:47.320 --> 26:49.360
I'll become a great knight like Father.

26:55.600 --> 26:57.400
(Mr. Azik's gaze was so gentle,)

26:58.440 --> 27:00.000
(unlike the one in the painting.)

27:17.960 --> 27:18.840
(What happened?)

27:19.440 --> 27:21.240
(Mr. Azik seemed
like a different person.)

27:24.480 --> 27:25.360
These are...

27:38.200 --> 27:40.720
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

27:49.000 --> 27:50.400
F-Father.

27:58.320 --> 27:59.240
Father!

28:49.152 --> 28:50.080
Father.

29:05.960 --> 29:07.520
Mr. Azik, wake up.

29:08.960 --> 29:09.952
(Azik Eggers, Unknown Sequence, Corpse Collector Pathway)
Mr. Azik?

29:20.832 --> 29:21.760
My child,

29:22.640 --> 29:25.160
my departure didn't free you
from misfortune.

29:26.400 --> 29:27.640
(Sealed in a coffin to die?)

29:28.280 --> 29:29.440
(Who would be so vicious?)

29:31.880 --> 29:32.840
(The skull is missing.)

29:34.560 --> 29:37.120
The traces are within three months.

29:37.960 --> 29:38.816
Now I understand.

29:39.328 --> 29:40.960
The corpse-sealing ritual was sabotaged.

29:41.360 --> 29:42.760
So the wraith appeared.

29:49.800 --> 29:51.520
The person who took your skull

29:52.720 --> 29:54.720
will pay tenfold.

29:59.000 --> 30:00.040
Bloodline

30:00.480 --> 30:01.320
Trace.

30:10.752 --> 30:11.648
(Me?)

30:28.920 --> 30:30.760
Mr. Azik, what are you doing?

31:02.120 --> 31:03.000
It's untraceable.

31:07.744 --> 31:08.640
Moreover,

31:09.040 --> 31:10.640
I sense that force again

31:10.920 --> 31:12.760
that makes your fate dissonant.

31:14.360 --> 31:16.120
(No wonder the trace led back to me.)

31:17.280 --> 31:18.760
That power is formidable.

31:20.544 --> 31:21.408
But don't worry,

31:22.080 --> 31:22.960
I'll find him.

31:24.240 --> 31:25.440
Perhaps it can help you too.

31:30.895 --> 31:37.376
(Tenor Eggers, a valiant knight)

31:47.160 --> 31:48.032
Mr. Azik,

31:48.704 --> 31:51.040
have you remembered who you are?

31:52.880 --> 31:54.320
Only fragments have returned.

31:54.960 --> 31:56.320
The rest remains blurred.

31:58.080 --> 31:58.976
Perhaps

31:59.760 --> 32:01.560
I'm someone who's lived countless years.

32:04.040 --> 32:06.360
(Perhaps you're connected to Death.)

32:07.440 --> 32:08.400
Every few decades,

32:08.760 --> 32:09.960
I fell into deep slumber.

32:10.720 --> 32:12.800
When I awakened,
I'd forget everything else,

32:13.760 --> 32:14.680
but my name,

32:15.080 --> 32:16.080
basic knowledge,

32:16.560 --> 32:17.800
and an identity document.

32:20.200 --> 32:22.360
Then the dreams began again.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.520
Sometimes I had a daughter

32:26.120 --> 32:28.040
who adored the swing I built.

32:29.800 --> 32:31.040
Other times I was a lord

32:31.520 --> 32:33.520
with a beautiful wife
and three children.

32:34.680 --> 32:35.800
I deeply loved my family.

32:37.320 --> 32:39.240
But I always ended up
hurting them in the end.

32:42.480 --> 32:43.520
At the end of every dream,

32:44.080 --> 32:45.320
I left alone.

32:49.120 --> 32:51.600
So those weren't dreams,

32:52.240 --> 32:53.720
but my fate in myriad reincarnations.

32:56.880 --> 32:57.824
Later,

32:57.824 --> 33:00.400
maybe because the pain of separation
was etched into my soul,

33:00.840 --> 33:02.320
I stopped seeking the warmth of home.

33:02.960 --> 33:04.120
I started living by myself.

33:04.800 --> 33:06.680
I lost track
of how many lifetimes have passed.

33:08.360 --> 33:09.280
(Brief joy.)

33:09.600 --> 33:10.480
(Lasting loneliness.)

33:11.240 --> 33:12.192
(Is this)

33:12.440 --> 33:14.440
(the price of possessing a long life?)

33:16.160 --> 33:17.840
Thank you very much, Klein,

33:18.720 --> 33:20.080
for helping me regain my memories.

33:29.040 --> 33:30.320
(You could never imagine)

33:31.240 --> 33:32.400
(what it's like for someone)

33:32.560 --> 33:33.720
(who has no past.)

33:34.680 --> 33:35.920
(I was like a ship at sea,)

33:36.680 --> 33:38.880
(drifting endlessly
without destination.)

33:40.080 --> 33:40.960
(Now,)

33:41.600 --> 33:43.040
(I finally see a course to follow.)

33:54.880 --> 33:55.776
(I can understand,)

33:56.080 --> 33:57.120
(Mr. Azik.)

33:58.560 --> 33:59.720
(In this world,)

34:00.200 --> 34:01.320
(I'm also a lone boat.)

34:02.440 --> 34:04.240
(I wonder
when I'll see my parents again)

34:05.056 --> 34:05.952
(and return home.)

34:16.320 --> 34:17.200
(But fortunately,)

34:18.080 --> 34:19.440
(I still have Benson and Melissa)

34:20.440 --> 34:21.960
(and a safe harbor to cherish.)

34:23.320 --> 34:24.720
(However, I'm not the real Klein)

34:25.680 --> 34:26.720
(and will leave someday.)

34:30.160 --> 34:31.400
(The ending is predetermined.)

34:32.480 --> 34:34.040
(I'll spend more of my remaining time)

34:34.760 --> 34:36.240
(with Benson and Melissa as Klein.)

34:38.640 --> 34:40.120
(I'll cherish our time together)

34:41.040 --> 34:43.640
(to leave enough memories
for reminiscence.)

34:45.152 --> 34:46.016
I'm home.

35:34.895 --> 35:40.076
♪Burn my broken shell to new sight♪

35:40.869 --> 35:48.635
♪To be free in mist
to hold a cup of light♪

35:48.914 --> 35:52.283
♪Where are the flames
that come in fury?♪

35:52.497 --> 35:55.707
♪Where are the keys
that carve truth from me?♪

35:55.921 --> 36:01.499
♪Into the dark
to dream and scream my name♪

36:01.499 --> 36:04.699
♪Wonder or dismay♪

36:04.699 --> 36:08.325
♪Madness or decay♪

36:08.849 --> 36:10.905
♪With fragile light♪

36:10.905 --> 36:14.971
♪I vow to guard a world I stay♪

36:14.971 --> 36:18.634
♪Stirring or delay♪

36:18.634 --> 36:21.947
♪Rebirth or be same♪

36:22.514 --> 36:27.781
♪With whispers in gray
guide my shadow way♪

36:28.050 --> 36:31.611
♪Fade away♪
